y, they will call upon the Feranmut's power to disappear from the enemy's sight before reappearing at a more opportune time.","abilities":["If defeated within range of a Bloodcalling Altar, slips into a turbulence in spacetime and cannot be attacked during this period.","Will revive on the field when affected by an altar's pulse."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":5000,"atk":350,"def":200,"res":60,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"blood_amber":{"slug":"blood_amber","name":"Blood Amber","icon":"/enemies-icons/Blood Amber.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"The blood that flows from warriors under the gaze of the Sanguinarch of Vampires will be turned into beautiful crystals waiting to be used once more, waiting to savor the taste of despair once more.","abilities":["When affected by the pulse of a Bloodcalling Altar, will be reborn as a Bloodborn Spawn at the altar."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":3000,"atk":100,"def":3000,"res":90,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1}},"sarkaz_boneguard_flayer":{"slug":"sarkaz_boneguard_flayer","name":"Sarkaz Boneguard Flayer","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sarkaz Boneguard Flayer.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A professional armsmaster responsible for protecting the Feranmut's skeleton, carefully selected by the Military Commission. They use witchcraft to connect themselves with the Feranmut's nerves, allowing the entire skeleton to become their weapon.","abilities":["Recovers a portion of HP and gains increased ATK when either enemy or friendly units are defeated within range (can stack).","Leaves behind 2 <Blood Amber> when defeated."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"l